pany?\nUser: It's Bright Smile Dental. I'm ready to book the live call for tomorrow.\nAgent: Nice, Bright Smile Dental — thanks. Quick check, Maria: you’re calling from Central time, right?\nUser: Yes, that's correct. I'm in the Central time zone, here in Chicago.\nAgent: Perfect, thanks for confirming, Maria. I can get you in tomorrow at either 11:30 or 12:15 in the afternoon Central — which works better for you?\nUser: Let's book it for 12:15 in the afternoon, please.\nAgent: One moment while I confirm that.\nAgent: Thanks, Maria — you’re all set for tomorrow at 12:15 in the afternoon Central with Jay for Bright Smile Dental. You’ll receive a text message with the confirmation details shortly, and you can add it to your calendar or reschedule with one click if you need to. Is there anything else I can help you with before we wrap up?",
